OL,3,GNEWSATeesside community unites for Boro
OL,4,A150 performance
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community performance involving 300
OL,7,Fdancers and a new song will take place
OL,8,Fon the pitch at the Riverside Stadium
OL,9,Fto celebrate the 150th anniversary of
OL,10,FMiddlesbrough Football club.
OL,12,FThe dance and the new song - The Sound
OL,13,Fof Teesside - will be performed ahead
OL,14,Fof Boro's match against Cardiff City on
OL,15,F17 October.
OL,17,FTees Valley Music Service, which has
OL,18,Farranged the performance, have involved
OL,19,Fcommunity choirs, youth choirs, as well
OL,20,Fas dancers from youth dance companies,
OL,21,Fschools, colleges and community groups.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
